# prev/at + question-word identifier fallbacks take the full postfix chain
# since the v0.23.0 pin (upstream #328). AOT subset: list indexing only (no
# dict literals / list-slice values in the AOT subset — dot and slice postfix
# are covered by the self-host corpus, test/programs/soft_keyword_postfix.eigs).
prev is [1, 2, 3]
print of prev[0]
at is [4, 5]
print of at[1]
for how in [[10, 20]]:
    print of how[1]
# special form still wins over the fallback
x is 1
x is 5
print of (prev of x)
